    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, verb. Adj. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵημι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sent</i>, only in compds., as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν-ετός, ἀφ-ετός</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτρᾰγον</span></b> , aor. 2 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρώγω</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔττακαν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστησαν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔττε</span></b> , v. sub
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστε</span>.</div>
